    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This light-filled ground floor one bedroom apartment offers approximately 40 square meters of modern accommodation in a superb location. The west facing open plan lounge dining room features a dual fuel stove and laminated oak wood floors and overlooks the communal gardens, creating a bright and welcoming living space. There is a separate oak fitted kitchen complete with appliances.\r\n\r\nThe double bedroom includes fitted mirrored slide robes and is served by a family bathroom. The apartment further benefits from double glazed windows and electric storage heating.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property overlooks well-maintained communal gardens and has the benefit of communal parking. Ideally situated on the doorstep of Newbridge Park and just a 10 minute walk from Donabate village and train station, offering easy access to local amenities and commuter links. Management fees are approximately €1,000 per year, covering block insurance, rubbish disposal, exterior lighting, landscaping, and parking."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall: 5' 7\" * 4' 7\"\r\nTiled floor, hot press, storage room. \r\n\r\nLounge/dining area: 17' 4\" * 13' 9\"\r\nWest facing accommodation,  Oak solid wood floor, log burning stove, bay window, coved ceiling, TV point. \r\n\r\nKitchen: 6' 9\" * 5' 2\" \r\nOak Wall and floor mounted kitchen units, washing machine, fridge/freezer, hob, double oven, extractor fan, tiled floor, window. \r\n\r\nBedroom: 11' 6\" * 8' 2\"\r\nEast facing accommodation, Laminated floor, Mirrored slide robes. \r\n\r\nBathroom: 7' 4\" * 5' 1\"\r\nWC, WHB, bath with shower extension, extractor fan, tiled floor, part tiled walls. \r\n\r\nOUTSIDE\r\nCommunal parking, communal gardens, bin shed and storage shed."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Ground floor\r\n40 Sq Meters\r\nWest facing lounge\r\nDual fuel stove\r\nParking\r\nD/G PVC windows\r\nElectric storage heating\r\nManagement fee approximately €1000 per year\r\n10 min walk from Donabate village and train station"
      },
      {
